 '包含 Kotlin、Java、XML、C/C++ 等受支持文本；跳过构建目录、符号链接、单文件超过 512 KiB 的文件。最多 5,000 文件和 32 MiB。':'Includes supported text such as Kotlin, Java, XML, and C/C++. Build directories, symbolic links, and files over 512 KiB are skipped. The snapshot is limited to 5,000 files and 32 MiB.','Gradle 工程会额外包含 build/outputs/mapping 下的 mapping.txt，用于 R8 / ProGuard 混淆符号定位。':'For Gradle projects, mapping.txt files under build/outputs/mapping are also included to resolve R8 / ProGuard obfuscated symbols.','R8 / ProGuard 映射':'R8 / ProGuard mapping','通过 mapping.txt 解混淆：':'Deobfuscated with mapping.txt:','仅支持 GitHub 和 android.googlesource.com 的公开仓库。需要本机 Git 和网络；浅克隆的临时下载量可能大于快照上限，不读取子模块或 Git LFS 对象。':'Only public repositories on GitHub and android.googlesource.com are supported. Local Git and network access are required. A shallow clone may temporarily download more than the snapshot limit. Submodules and Git LFS objects are not read.','声明候选（按名称、类和包名排序；需核对版本、重载及归属）':'declaration candidates (sorted by name, class, and package; verify revision, overload, and ownership)','匹配':'matches','条':'matches','没有匹配':'No matches','可尝试类名、函数名或文件名。':'Try a class name, function name, or file name.','快照文件':'Snapshot file','最多显示前 300 文件；可搜索全部快照文件。':'Showing up to 300 files; search covers the entire snapshot.','文件':'files','文件 / 行':'File / line','匹配内容':'Matched text','大小':'Size','已保存快照':'Saved snapshots','选择快照':'Choose a snapshot','本地目录':'Local directory','HTTPS 仓库地址':'HTTPS repository URL','分支、标签或完整提交 ID':'Branch, tag, or full commit ID','获取远程快照':'Fetch remote snapshot','搜索快照':'Search snapshot','文本搜索':'Text search','第 ':'Lines ',' 行':'lines','上一页':'Previous page','下一页':'Next page',
 '正在读取 APK 并解析资源…':'Reading APK and parsing resources…','正在分析新 APK；完成后更新结果…':'Analyzing the new APK; results will update when complete…','APK 应用图标':'APK app icon','APK 文件体积':'APK file size','原始 APK 大小，含容器开销':'Original APK size, including container overhead','文件条目':'File entries','个':'items','DEX 文件':'DEX files','支持多 DEX 文件头统计':'Supports file-header statistics for multiple DEX files','Native 库':'Native libraries','没有 lib/ ABI 库':'No lib/ ABI libraries','APK 分析视图':'APK analysis views','文件体积':'File sizes','签名证书':'Signing certificates','APK 文件分类':'APK file category','筛选 APK 文件':'Filter APK files','搜索路径、后缀或文件名…':'Search paths, extensions, or file names…','未声明':'Not declared','APK 组件类型':'APK component type','全部组件':'All components','检测到的方案':'Detected schemes','未检测到':'None detected','APK Signing Block 大小':'APK Signing Block size','证书记录':'Certificate records','公钥':'Public key','有效期':'Validity period','序列号':'Serial number','包名':'Package name','分片名称':'Split name','基础 APK / 未声明':'Base APK / not declared','DEX 代码':'DEX code','res 资源':'Resource files','assets 资源':'Asset files','资源表':'Resource table','其他文件':'Other files','容器开销':'Container overhead','看清每一份安装包':'Understand every APK','导入 APK，定位体积来源，查看应用声明与签名证书。':'Import an APK to inspect its size breakdown, app declarations, and signing certificates.','支持单个 APK，最大 512 MB；分析全程在本机完成。':'Analyze one APK up to 512 MB; all analysis stays on this computer.','包信息与 Manifest':'Package details and Manifest','体积与大文件':'Size breakdown and large files','DEX / ABI':'DEX / ABI','APK 分析':'APK analysis','在本机检查安装包结构、Manifest 和证书，无需连接设备。':'Inspect APK structure, Manifest, and certificates locally without a connected device.','压缩体积是 ZIP 条目中的存储字节，展开体积是条目声明的原始字节；容器开销不属于任何单个文件。没有将 APK 内容解压到目录。':'Compressed size is the number of bytes stored for each ZIP entry; uncompressed size is the original size declared by the entry. Container overhead is not assigned to individual files. APK contents are not extracted to a directory.','这是 Manifest 中的权限声明，不代表系统已授予权限；未推断权限保护级别或应用运行时行为。':'These are permission declarations in the Manifest; they do not show whether the system has granted them. Permission protection levels and runtime behavior are not inferred.','exported / enabled 显示 Manifest 的显式值，未声明不等于 false。组件名已按包名展开；点击一行查看 actions、categories 和其他声明。':'exported / enabled show explicit Manifest values; undeclared does not mean false. Component names are expanded using the package name. Select a row to inspect actions, categories, and other declarations.','由二进制 Manifest 生成的可读 XML。资源引用可能保留为资源 ID；不等同于原始源码中的 XML、注释或格式。':'Readable XML generated from the binary Manifest. Resource references may remain as IDs. This is not the original source XML, comments, or formatting.','method_ids 是方法 ID 引用数，跨 DEX 可以重复；不是去重后的方法数，也不是应用自行定义的方法数。这里读取文件头，不做反编译或 DEX 完整性校验。':'method_ids counts method ID references, which can repeat across DEX files. It is not a deduplicated method count or the number of methods defined by the app. This reads file headers; it does not decompile or validate DEX integrity.','不推断 assets 或其他位置文件的 ABI。':'ABI is not inferred from assets or files in other locations.','检测范围为 v1 / v2 / v3 / v3.1，仅识别签名结构并提取证书。未验证 APK 内容签名、证书信任链或可安装性；“检测到 v2”等标记不表示签名验证通过。v4 的独立 .idsig 文件不包含在单个 APK 中。':'Detection covers v1 / v2 / v3 / v3.1 structures and extracts certificates. APK content signatures, certificate trust chains, and installability are not verified. A “v2 detected” label does not mean signature verification passed. The separate v4 .idsig file is not part of a single APK.','完整验证未执行':'Full verification not performed','仅分析此 APK 的静态声明；不运行、安装或上传应用，也不会合并其他 split APK。':'Only static declarations in this APK are analyzed. The app is not run, installed, or uploaded, and other split APKs are not merged.','点击分类定位大文件。容器开销包括 ZIP 结构、APK 签名块与填充。展开量不等于安装占用。':'Select a category to locate large files. Container overhead includes ZIP structures, the APK Signing Block, and padding. Uncompressed size is not installed size.','没有 classes*.dex':'No classes*.dex files','当前 APK 可能是资源分片。':'This APK may be a resource split.','没有 lib/ 下的 .so':'No .so files under lib/','没有匹配的文件':'No matching files','调整分类或文件名筛选。':'Adjust the category or file-name filter.','没有此类组件':'No components of this type','请选择其他类型。':'Choose another component type.','无自定义权限':'No custom permissions','当前 Manifest 没有 permission 声明。':'The Manifest contains no permission declarations.','当前 Manifest 没有 uses-permission。':'The Manifest contains no uses-permission declarations.','当前 APK 没有请求权限':'This APK requests no permissions.',
