 '每份单独保存的 AndroidX 报告作为一个实验单位，使用该报告指标中位数做 95% 百分位 Bootstrap 区间；每侧至少 5 份，最多 100 份。请选不同的独立测试运行，不要把同一报告中的 iterations 当作独立实验。区间是探索性估计，不是 p 值、不证明因果；应用无法确认实验是否真正独立。':'Each separately saved AndroidX report is one experiment unit, represented by its report-level metric median. A 95% percentile bootstrap interval is calculated with at least 5 and up to 100 reports per group. Select distinct test runs; iterations within one report are not independent experiments. This is an exploratory interval, not a p-value or proof of causation. The app cannot verify that experiments are truly independent.',
