 '每份独立保存的 JSON 报告为一个实验单位；报告内部迭代先聚合为该报告中位数。区间使用两组报告中位数的独立重抽样，不将单份报告的 runs 展开成实验样本。它是探索性 95% Bootstrap 区间，不是 p 值或因果结论；是否独立由你根据运行过程核实。':'Each separately saved JSON report is one experiment unit; iterations in that report are first aggregated into its median. The interval independently resamples report medians and does not treat one report’s runs as experiment samples. It is an exploratory 95% bootstrap interval, not a p-value or causal conclusion. Verify independence from the test procedure.',
