 '功能取决于设备权限、Android 版本和外部工具。完整 Compose Inspector 需要 API 29+ 与目标调试接口；实时网络只采集接入 OkHttp Agent 的请求；系统 UID mAh 是估计值，不是实测功耗。':'Features depend on device permissions, Android version, and external tools. Full Compose Inspector requires API 29+ and a debuggable target interface. Live network capture covers only requests from apps using the OkHttp Agent. System UID mAh values are estimates, not measured power consumption.',
 '数据仅保存在当前电脑，不调用 AI 或上传服务。实时数据最多保留 1,800 个样本；图表展示最近 120 个。停止采集后请手动保存记录。':'Data stays on this computer; no AI or upload service is used. Live data keeps up to 1,800 samples, and charts show the latest 120. Save sessions manually after capture.',
